### ============================================
### GROUP 2: INTERNAL AUDIO SCENARIOS (4)
### Audio operations SKIPPED → Video provider creates audio internally
### ============================================

### ============================================
### SCENARIO 9: Fast Outline + (audio ignored) + Fast Internal Video
### outline-fast (5s) + [audio-quick selected but SKIPPED] + video-fast-internal (5s)
